  "conclusion": "Raw contributing area contains the same parallel/diagonal structure as concentration and combined scores. D8routing and faceted/flat terrain are plausible contributors; this does not establish surveyed microtopography, physical drainage paths, or observed flood hotspots. De-emphasize concentration/combined results as experimental routing diagnostics.",
